  "notes": "Backlog game, picked from RAWG's most-added list for its year (docs/PLAN.md section 2 ordering). StrategyWiki has no page for this game (API returned missing for \"Biomutant\" and \"BIOMUTANT\"). biomutant.fandom.com answers the API, with about 15 linked pages, including \"Tribes\", \"Mutation\", \"Wushu\" and \"Tree-of-Life\"; names only were looked at, nothing copied. None of the 46 Steam achievements is hidden, so the story chapter holds only escaping Bunker 101 and the World Eater achievements. \"Under the Table\" (a drinking contest against Gulp) was placed in exploration and encounters, which is a judgement call. RAWG lists a playtime of only 5 hours, which looks low."
